  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 AFG049 * Supporting Humanitarian Assistance and Protection in Afghanistan (SHAPE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solutions for Inclusive and Integrated Protection Services (SIIPS) project is part of the Supporting Humanitarian Assistance and Protection in Afghanistan programme (SHAPE). 

The SIIPS project aims to increase protection services for women, children, and persons with disabilities in Afghanistan.

The three main goals of the project are:
- Community structures&#xA0;are able to prevent risks and&#xA0;respond to unmet&#xA0;protection needs thereby reducing the&#xA0;adoption of negative&#xA0;coping strategies
- People&apos;s access to humanitarian assistance and protection services is enhanced, especially for persons with disability  
- Survivors of gender-based violence and child abuse are provided with timely support tailored to their specific needs through case management services and referral mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
